SSttaarrttiinngg rrppccaappdd oonn UUnniixx‐‐lliikkee ssyysstteemmss
       rrppccaappdd needs sufficient privileges to perform packet capture, e.g.  run
       as root or be owned by root and have suid set. Most  operating  systems
       provide  more  elegant  solutions when run as user than the above solu‐
       tions, all of them different.

